{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 47, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "**Discovering Japan: A Whirlwind Adventure**\n\nMy trip to Japan was a dream come true, packed with vibrant cities, serene temples, and unforgettable flavors.\n\nI started in **Tokyo**, where neon lights met ancient traditions. Exploring **Shibuya Crossing**, I marveled at the chaos of a million people moving in perfect harmony. A short train ride to **Asakusa** led me to **Senso-ji Temple**, its grand gates and incense-filled streets offering a peaceful escape. At night, the **Tokyo Skytree** lit up the sky, casting shadows over the Sumida River.\n\nNext, I ventured to **Kyoto**, the heart of traditional Japan. Strolling through **Fushimi Inari Shrine**, I followed the endless torii gates winding up the mountain, each one a wish for safe travels. The **Arashiyama Bamboo Forest** felt like stepping into a painting—tall stalks swaying gently in the breeze. Tea ceremonies at a **machiya** (traditional townhouse) taught me the art of mindfulness, one sip at a time.\n\nFor a taste of nature, **Nara** welcomed me with its friendly deer roaming freely near **Todai-ji Temple**. Feeding them from my palm was a moment of pure joy.\n\nFinally, I ended in **Osaka**, where street food ruled. **Dotonbori’s** glowing signs and sizzling takoyaki (octopus balls) made every bite an adventure. A night at the **Universal Studios Japan** park, complete with a **Harry Potter**-themed ride, brought my trip full circle.\n\nJapan left me in awe—where cutting-edge tech and timeless customs coexist in perfect balance. Already counting the days until my next visit!", "logprobs": [{"token": "**", "logprob": -0.06550939381122589}, {"token": "Dis", "logprob": -2.5284337997436523}, {"token": "cover", "logprob": -0.0001003691868390888}, {"token": "ing", "logprob": -0.0006250573205761611}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.4949835240840912}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.64